    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/1e7d3e6eaa087bf4354580153d72c424.poster.avif?t=1753962018\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/1e7d3e6eaa087bf4354580153d72c424.webm?t=1753962018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/1e7d3e6eaa087bf4354580153d72c424.mp4?t=1753962018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Low wage. Exhaustion. Expensive fish and chips. Welcome to the United Kingdom.  <br><br>DIGGERGUN is an oppressive life sim platformer about workers, minimum pay and the environment. You\u2019re trapped on a blustery island, forced to work at Cornwall Mining Corp where it\u2019s shadier than the game\u2019s monochrome palette. <br><br>To escape, you need to earn \u00a33000 from digging precious lithium. To survive, you need to manage your time, energy and money during the rigid day-and-night cycle.<br><br>Will you make ends meet while digging for freedom or find another way out and bring down the whole bloomin\u2019 system?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> An atmospheric world with fleshed-out characters; everyone you meet has their own distinct personality and storyline. <br></li><li> Multiple endings: who you interact with (or don\u2019t) will change the outcome of your story.<br></li><li> Unique energy system where your actions truly matter as the game tracks your gameplay and punishes/rewards you for your choices.<br></li><li> Life sim where wages, food, rent, and much more are based on the current cost-of-living in the United Kingdom. There's even a tax system calculated to real-world rates!<br></li><li> Diverse range of randomly generated mines and intricately hand-designed levels to ensure you\u2019re always kept on your toes.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/8284e584e49b8695daf815c98459401e.poster.avif?t=1753962018\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/8284e584e49b8695daf815c98459401e.webm?t=1753962018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
