ur toes.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/8284e584e49b8695daf815c98459401e.poster.avif?t=1753962018\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/8284e584e49b8695daf815c98459401e.webm?t=1753962018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
